\ A raise from `with-parameter` inside a compiled body must render the `with-parameter` frame
\ innermost, with the caller chain intact.
\
\ The eager suite reuses this golden, so passing both modes is the parity check.
bind-and-run: ( -- n ) [ 42 config-key: [ 1 ] with-parameter ] ;
apply-config: ( -- s ) [ bind-and-run inspect ] ;
apply-config drop
